2|0@EliteDangerous^1439316039#ctze53j:shArkh$:Currently there's a group system, but not a guild/corp one. There's something in the works for player-created minor factions (corps, sort-of...) we're hoping to hear more about soon. PvP-centric areas are pretty much anywhere large numbers of players are known to congregate. Anyone can shoot you anywhere, it's not like CONCORDE reaming your ass in eve, so... :)))) Out-of-game, there are several groups that focus on PvP and piracy (East India Company, The Code as eg's) and also there is a "Powerplay" mechanic, where you pledge allegiance to a major NPC faction. Any players in hostile factions (i.e. err... any, really) you can have-at with abandon, provided you're outside a station's no-fire zone.
